      "statement": "The DP-3 editions form a supersession chain: 2012-11 is superseded by 2020-08 for policies effective on or after 2020-08-01, and 2020-08 is superseded by 2026-01 for policies effective on or after 2026-01-01; each superseded edition remains applicable to policies written under it.",
